    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76,
        2225,
        1589,
        2333
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Remember, this is New York's unified campaign to keep the City a leader in helping its fellow men. I am sure that we can count on your wholehearted assistance in support of The Greater New York Fund.",
